<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish industrial output rises/fall 5.0 pct in Oct.</title>
<headline>Irish industrial output rises/fall 5.0 pct in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish industrial production rose a seasonally adjusted 5.0 percent in October after a 3.1 percent fall in September, Central Statistics Office (CSO) data showed on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
